@startuml
title A change of infrastructure, from proposal to production

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

component "Pull request\nthe change, as code" as PR
component "Checks\nformat, validation,\nsecurity scan" as CHK #FFF8E1
component "Plan\nwhat would change,\nposted on the request" as PLAN #FFF8E1
component "Review\na person reads\nthe plan" as REV #FFE0B2
component "Apply: shared\nthen test" as A1 #E3F2FD
component "Apply:\nintegration" as A2 #FFF8E1
component "Apply: prod\nafter approval" as A3 #C8E6C9

PR --> CHK
CHK --> PLAN
PLAN --> REV
REV --> A1 : merge
A1 --> A2 : tests of test pass
A2 --> A3 : approval

note bottom of A3
  Each apply uses the plan that was reviewed.
  A nightly plan of every root must be empty:
  anything else is a drift, and an alert.
end note
@enduml
